        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/f07891/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-06T09:52:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'm new to these forums so hopefully I'm doing this right and posting in the correct forum.</p>\n<p>Does anyone know which European distributors will receive the 6th printings of Spirit Island? The 'State of GTG' posts mention shipping of this edition, to arrive in Europe around Nov/Dec but at the moment&nbsp;all the games shops in the UK seem to be receiving 4th printings! It would be useful to know which retailers would receive the new versions first.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks for any guidance ...</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:15.810Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
