        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm new to these forums so hopefully I'm doing this right and posting in the correct forum.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Does anyone know which European distributors will receive the 6th printings of Spirit Island? The 'State of GTG' posts mention shipping of this edition, to arrive in Europe around Nov/Dec but at the moment&nbsp;all the games shops in the UK seem to be receiving 4th printings! It would be useful to know which retailers would receive the new versions first.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks for any guidance ...</p>",
